---
alwaysApply: true
---

ROUTING RULES

- Use plural route naming.
- Examples:
  /admin/events
  /admin/users
  /admin/orders
  /admin/ticket-types

TECH STACK

- React Vite
- TailwindCSS
- Shadcn UI preferred
- Zustand
- Axios
- JavaScript JSX (no TypeScript)

PROJECT STRUCTURE

- Shared reusable components:
  src/components

- Shared admin layout components:
  src/layouts/AdminLayout/components

- Page-specific components:
  inside that page/feature components folder

LAYOUT STRUCTURE
src/layouts
├── AdminLayout
├── AuthLayout
└── PublicLayout

COMPONENT RULES

- Use PascalCase for component names.
- Page root uses index.jsx.
- Components use direct PascalCase file naming.

Examples:

Events/
├── index.jsx

components/
├── AdminSidebar.jsx
├── EventTable.jsx

UI STYLE

- Minimal SaaS dashboard style.
- Vibe similar to Shadcn UI dashboard kits.
- Clean spacing and soft borders.
- Support dark theme.
- Avoid flashy UI and overdesigned gradients.

RESPONSIVE RULES

- Fully responsive for all screen sizes.
- Desktop sidebar fixed/collapsible.
- Mobile sidebar uses drawer/sheet.
- Tables use horizontal scroll if needed.
- Forms stack vertically on mobile.

PAGE STRUCTURE

1. PageHeader
2. StatsCards (optional)
3. Toolbar
4. MainContent/Table/Form
5. Pagination

CRUD RULES

- Create/Edit use separate pages.
- Detail uses separate pages.
- Delete uses confirm dialog.
- Tables support checkbox row selection.
- Support bulk actions when appropriate.

ICON RULES

- Use lucide-react only.

ANIMATION RULES

- Minimal animation only.
- Use subtle hover/fade interactions.
- Follow Shadcn UI interaction style.
- Avoid heavy motion effects.

CODING STYLE

- Prioritize reusable components.
- Keep pages clean and compositional.
- Avoid huge JSX files.
- Split reusable UI logically.
- Avoid over-splitting tiny UI parts.
